SUMMARY:Yolo County Board of Education Meeting
DESCRIPTION:The Yolo County Office of Education meetings offer insight into how the county’s educational priorities\, policies\, and programs serve local students and communities. Regular meetings are generally held on the second Tuesday of each month at 3:30 p.m. at the Yolo County Office of Education in Woodland. Meetings are open to the public\, with online viewing available via Zoom. \n  \nThe Yolo County Office of Education oversees county-level educational matters\, including policies and programs that support students\, schools\, and districts throughout Yolo County. Meeting agendas\, packets\, and minutes are available online. \n  \nFor more information about meeting dates\, agendas\, public comment\, and online access\, visit the Yolo County Office of Education Board Meetings website or contact the Superintendent’s Office at (530) 668-3702.
URL:https://hatefreetogether.org/event/yolo-county-board-of-education-meeting/2026-11-10/
LOCATION:Yolo County Office of Education\, 1280 Santa Anita Court\, Woodland\, CA\, 95776
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://hatefreetogether.org/wp-content/uploads/yolo_county_office_of_education_cover-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
