SUMMARY:Davis Phoenix Coalition: Upstander Carnival
DESCRIPTION:The Davis Phoenix Coalition will host an Upstander Carnival for elementary-aged children from 10:00 a.m. to 2:00 p.m. at Marguerite Montgomery Elementary in Davis\, California. The carnival will feature familiar carnival games\, snacks\, and resources\, with opportunities for participants to learn about being an upstander and how to respond to bullying. The goal is to equip children with practical tools and resources to help them navigate these common and impactful situations and encourage them to stand up for others.
URL:https://hatefreetogether.org/event/davis-phoenix-coalition-upstander-carnival/
LOCATION:Marguerite Montgomery Elementary\, 1441 Danbury Avenue\, Davis\, CA\, 95618\, United States
CATEGORIES:Season of Connection
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://hatefreetogether.org/wp-content/uploads/Davis-Phoenix-Coalition-Upstander-Carnival.jpg
END:VEVENT
