SUMMARY:Yolo County Library: English Conversation Group
DESCRIPTION:Join the Yolo County Davis Branch Library’s adult Conversation Group to practice your English in a fun and relaxed way with help from a group facilitator. Drop in visitors are welcome! For adults 18+. Location is the Mary L. Stephens Library’ Blanchard Room on Monday’s at 3:00 p.m. until the end of 2026.
